{#
/**
 * @file
 * Couple Story inline block — block_content.couple_story_block, default display.
 *
 * This LB inline block sits in About §3 (bg-base-100, py-12) at weight 1,
 * below the community heading text block (weight 0). It renders the couple
 * entity via the couple_story view mode.
 *
 * The couple_story view mode outputs:
 *   - Community arc prose (field_community_story)
 *   - Dual person faces (field_couple → person:couple_faces)
 *   - Milestone list (field_milestone → ui_suite_daisyui:timeline_item)
 *
 * Hierarchy:
 *   LB section (bg-base-100 py-12, via UI Styles)
 *     ├─ weight 0: text block with h2 "Along the way, in the open"
 *     └─ weight 1: .reading-column (this template)
 *          └─ node.couple.couple_story → node--couple--couple-story.html.twig
 *               ├─ field_community_story (prose)
 *               ├─ field_couple (dual faces, couple_faces view mode)
 *               └─ field_milestone (DaisyUI timeline)
 *
 * The reading-column wrapper centres the content (68ch max-inline-size).
 *
 * Available content:
 * - content.field_couple  Rendered couple entity (couple_story view mode).
 *
 * @see node--couple--couple-story.html.twig
 * @see core.entity_view_display.block_content.couple_story_block.default
 */
#}
<div{{ attributes.addClass('block block--inline-block block--type-couple-story-block') }}>
  {{ title_prefix }}
  {{ title_suffix }}
  <div class="reading-column">
    {{ content.field_couple }}
  </div>
</div>
